{"4699250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Being 2", "steam_appid": 4699250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Being 2</strong> is an atmospheric horror walking simulator, visual novel and investigation game (with no jump scares).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a near-future Aotearoa New Zealand roadside landscape. You'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to find out why you were drawn to a tent city and a boarded-up building pierced by a huge tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect inventory items, read documents and destroy your mind and body to keep going and discover the secrets of the End of Work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Being 2</strong> also features an all-original electronic and guitar-based drone-and-riff score.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Being 2</strong> is an atmospheric horror walking simulator, visual novel and investigation game (with no jump scares).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a near-future Aotearoa New Zealand roadside landscape. You'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to find out why you were drawn to a tent city and a boarded-up building pierced by a huge tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect inventory items, read documents and destroy your mind and body to keep going and discover the secrets of the End of Work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Being 2</strong> also features an all-original electronic and guitar-based drone-and-riff score.</p>", "short_description": "Work has ended. Something told you to find the tower. You can only get in by obliterating your brain. What comes next?", "supported_languages": "English", "heade